name "Log Messages"

target "godot"
ast-set "target"

constant "script" "res://log/game_log.gd"
variable "logger"
variable "level" default="info"

description r#"Log Messages
============

This example sends what scripts print to a logger, with the name of the script's class, and adds the logger
to the project's autoloads. Both patches use the name of the logger, which is set in the configuration"#
